  "description_text": "Timeless Cape Cod style home surrounded by lush, mature landscaping in an incredible Alki location. The main level features a cozy living room with gas fireplace, light-filled kitchen and dining area, two bedrooms and a full bath. Hardwood floors and abundant windows add warmth and natural light throughout. Downstairs, a spacious rec room offers flexible living space alongside a utility/laundry room, ample storage and direct access to the attached one-car garage. Outside, enjoy a private backyard retreat with a generous patio surrounded by established greenery. Best of all, you're just one block from Alki Beach and moments from the neighborhood's beloved shops, restaurants and waterfront. Enjoy the best of Alki right outside your door!",
