  "description_text": "Situated on a sunny, spacious double lot along Marine View Drive in West Seattle this home offers a great opportunity to live in one of the most peaceful settings in the area. With peekaboo views of Puget Sound and Mount Rainier, a flexible floor plan and generous living spaces, there's room to make it your own. The main level has three size-able bedrooms, a large living room with abundant natural light, and a spacious kitchen and bathroom with original vintage details. The lower level offers an additional bedroom, huge family room, 3/4 bathroom and bonus space - all giving options for guests, a home office future MIL and hobbies. Outside, enjoy a flat, large, landscaped yard, a detached garage, patio and ample additional parking. Located in a quiet pocket of Arbor Heights, close Lincoln Park, Ferries, the Airport, shopping, schools, Arbor Heights Swim Club and so much more.",
